DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ggeettppaaggeessiizzee() function returns the number of bytes in a page.  Page
     granularity is the granularity of many of the memory management calls.

     The page size is a system page size and may not be the same as the under‐
     lying hardware page size.

     IEEE Std 1003.1-2001 (“POSIX.1”) removed ggeettppaaggeessiizzee.  Portable applica‐
     tions should use ‘sysconf(_SC_PAGESIZE)’ instead.

